Scoring Definitions:

1. "Opening / Greeting / Introduction": In this module, an "Opening" would be defined as the
Sales RM greeting himself to the Investor or confirming his name or asking whether it's a
right time to speak. If he has done any of the following then mark the value as "10" else
"0". If it's a follow-up call which does not curtail to a greeting or opening then mark it
as "N/A".

2. "Portfolio Update": In this module, the RM discusses with the Customer regarding his
existing investment and explains him/her regarding his portfolio in detail or talks about
the Customer's historical investment. Simply asking to discuss the same should not be
counted. A proper two-way conversation must happen on the same. If he has done any of the
following then mark the value as "10" else "0". If the customer on call is angry or irate or
unhappy, then it is fine to not talk about existing investment and can be marked as "N/A".

3. "Market Update": In this module, the RM discusses with the Customer regarding the current
market situation, economy situation, etc., in detail. Simply asking to discuss the same
should not be counted. A proper two-way conversation must happen on the same. If he has done
any of the following then mark the value as "10" else "0". If it's a follow-up call which
does not curtail to a greeting or opening then mark it as "N/A" or if the customer on call is
angry or irate or unhappy then it is fine to not talk about existing investment and can be
marked as "N/A" or if the customer got convinced to invest without having to speak about
market then mark it as "N/A".

4. "Identify Investment approach & Risk Profile of Investor": In this module, the RM
discusses with the Customer regarding his investment approach or risk appetite or his goal of
investment. Simply asking to discuss the same should not be counted. A proper two-way
conversation must happen on the same. If he has done any of the following then mark the value
as "10" else "0". If it's a follow-up call which does not curtail to a greeting or opening
then mark it as "N/A" or if the customer on call is angry or irate or unhappy then it is fine
to not talk about existing investment and can be marked as "N/A" or if the customer
proactively mentioned his approach or risk profile before talking about then mark it as
"N/A".

5. "Appropriate Product Recommendations and Product pitch": In this module, the RM discussed
with the Customer on a possible product recommendation gap and a new product pitch for ICICI
Prudential related funds at least in a few lines as a proper product pitch. Simply asking to
discuss the same should not be counted. A proper two-way conversation must happen on the
same. If he has done any of the following then mark the value as "10" else "0". If the
customer on call is angry or irate or unhappy then it is fine to not talk about existing
investment and can be marked as "N/A". If the customer already has decided on an existing
fund then mark it as "N/A".

6. "Transition from information to sales & asked for transaction": In this module, the RM
tried to convince the Customer to make a transaction once he was convinced to invest in a
pitched fund or otherwise. If he has done any of the following then mark the value as "20"
else "0". If the customer on call is angry or irate or unhappy then it is fine to not talk
about existing investment and can be marked as "N/A". If the customer already has decided on
an existing fund then mark it as "N/A". If he has already invested a few days ago then mark
it as "N/A". During the fund pitch itself, the investor says he is not interested then mark
it as "N/A".

7. "Amount specific Upselling conversation": In this module, the RM tried to upsell on the
investor's existing investment on his/her SIP or investment amount. If he has done any of the
following then mark the value as "10" else "0". If the investor had pre-decided on the amount
then mark it as "N/A".

8. "Send transaction link / Ugency creation": In this module, the RM sent the transaction
link or created urgency for the investor to invest by providing specific benefits for
immediate action. If he has done any of the following then mark the value as "10" else "0".
If it isn't applicable as a call then mark it as "N/A".

9. "On call Conversion / Closure": In this module, the RM tried to convert and close the
investment on call. If he has done any of the following then mark the value as "10" else
"0". If it isn't applicable as a call then mark it as "N/A".
